// Trade 1 LONG 98.35-98.50 / SL 98.25 / TP 98.67-98.73 / 3.2x / sub 98.50/98.40/98.35
// Trade 2 LONG 98.50 / SL 98.25 / TP 98.92-99.00 / 4.9x / sub 98.50/98.60/98.70
